    cml:operator "obligation" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Obligation to pay in accordance with proportions." ;
    cml:premiseText "If the total of the amounts payable to carriers out of the Universal Service Account is more than the balance of the Universal Service Account, after paying any refunds that are due under section 79 of the former law, the ACA must:" ;
